        <mxCell id="rf_overhead" value="&lt;b&gt;RF Bus Idle Overhead: 14,719 µs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:9px;opacity:0.85;&#x27;&gt;Includes RF frame timing gaps, antenna settling,
SPI clock overhead &amp; ISO 14443 guard times.
Included in WCET (28,500 µs). Visible nodes = 13,781 µs.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#f59e0b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#fde68a;fontStyle=0;fontSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
